improve or you cannot grow. That's not what we're looking for.

45
00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:49.440
Instead, I want to encourage you to seek this and

46
00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:50.200
only this,

47
00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:54.880
to maximize the amount of Jesus likeness you have in your

48
00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:55.440
heart and life.

49
00:02:56.680 --> 00:03:00.580
So if you've been seeking anything more than Jesus likeness, Christlikeness,

50
00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.700
adjust your expectations. If you've been seeking anything less

51
00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.800
than full Jesus likeness, Christlikeness, change that today

52
00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:12.620
because he's the standard of what human holiness looks like.

53
00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.120
When he calls you to "follow me," he's saying, "Follow me

54
00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.180
